==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|quīncunx|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkwɪŋkʌŋks/|lang=en}}
* {{IPA|/ˈkwɪnkʌŋks/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ʌŋks|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# An arrangement of five [[unit]]s in a pattern corresponding to the five-spot on [[dice]], playing cards, or [[domino]]es.
# {{lb|en|astrology}} An [[angle]] of five-twelfths of a circle, or 150°, between two objects. {{defdate|from 1647}}
# {{lb|en|historical|numismatics}} A [[bronze]] [[coin]] minted during the [[Rome|Roman Republic]], valued at five-twelfths of an [[as]]. {{defdate|from 1545}}

